<title>BELGIUM: Italian team has no comment after lira meeting.</title>
<headline>Italian team has no comment after lira meeting.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian representiatives on the European Union's monetary committee made no comment after it failed on Saturday to agree terms of the lira's re-entry into the Exchange Rate Mechanism (ERM).</p>
<p>The officials declined to speak to reporters when they emerged after nine hours of unconcluded talks at the committee.</p>
<p>Earlier, other officials said a crisis meeting of EU finance ministers would take place in Brussels on Sunday afternoon to try to end the stalemate.</p>
</text>
